WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.540
We ask for your protection over our school

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.340
and we pray that we will be kept from harm

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.340
throughout the night

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.520
Amen Amen

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.600
*singing* Shhhhh

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:19.700
Ms. Martha!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.440
Ms. Martha!!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.420
Is he dead?

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.060
No get him inside.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:26.260
Quick!

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.420
You're a most unwelcome visitor

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.680
and we do not propose to entertain you.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.020
You'll find that I'm easily amused.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.740
You won't be here long enough for that.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.940
How did you end up in this place?

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.500
Why are you so interested in me?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.140
I admire your strength.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.220
I'm just trying to give them what they need to survive in these times

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.220
If you have anything in the world what would it be?

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.160
To be taken far away from here

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.400
Come with me.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.220
He seems to be a sensitive person.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.660
Does he?

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:05.380
*giggles*

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.040
*gasp*

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.220
Nina!

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:11.960
John.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:18.460
It seems the enemy is not what we believe.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:21.800
Hope you like apple pie.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.380
Is that my recipe?

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.440
It is.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.740
*choking gasping*

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.740
I need rags.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.100
I need chloroform.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.340
Go to the smokehouse, get the saw, now.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.340
Bring me the anatomy book

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.020
Can I get you anything?

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.720
Get me the key.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.200
You know I'd get in trouble for that.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.080
*scream*

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.120
AAARG What have you done to me????

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.840
You vengeful bitches.

